/*
 * Implements semantic validation for macro call expressions.
 *
 * A macro call(`MacroCallExpr`) consists of:
 *
 *   - a left-hand side(the macro reference),
 *   - a content string to match and rewrite.
 *
 * MacroValidation is the final stage of the macro system: it bridges the
 * macro-solving engine with the semantic validator.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::macro_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/macro_.yr
 * @Author(s):
